WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.728
Six brackets, and each closer must meet the right opener.

00:08.728 --> 00:14.700
Scanning ahead for every match is slow.

00:15.000 --> 00:23.350
Instead, stack each opener as you read it.

00:23.350 --> 00:31.700
The stack remembers what is still waiting.

00:32.000 --> 00:40.173
Each closer checks only the top plate.

00:40.173 --> 00:47.700
If they match, the pair is settled.

00:48.000 --> 00:51.714
One pass, O(n) time.

00:51.714 --> 00:56.543
Empty stack, valid string.

00:56.543 --> 00:59.700
That’s the stack.

